WEBVTT

NOTE Narration is displayed in the caption strip below the video by default.

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.596
This fictional people map follows the work rather than stopping with the manager.

00:00:05.596 --> 00:00:08.609
Customers receive the service and supply information.

00:00:08.609 --> 00:00:12.053
Intake staff perform preparation and explain unfamiliar wording.

00:00:12.053 --> 00:00:16.358
A service reviewer checks the draft summary and owns correction.

00:00:16.358 --> 00:00:18.940
The service manager approves the process.

00:00:18.940 --> 00:00:21.523
Technical support helps with failed forms.

00:00:21.523 --> 00:00:30.132
Managers may benefit from clearer summaries, while customers may carry an unfamiliar entry step and staff may carry more explanation.

00:00:30.132 --> 00:00:35.298
These benefits and burdens need checking; no time saving is measured here.

00:00:35.298 --> 00:00:43.477
The customer has little influence over the internal decision, so review access and a human alternative from that perspective.

00:00:43.477 --> 00:00:46.490
A person's role suggests questions to ask.

00:00:46.490 --> 00:00:50.364
It does not prove their ability or their agreement.
